  "description": "Does a write that another process's open level refused succeed once that level ends by Rollback, and was an unrelated far row admitted meanwhile? Both processes open the main file shared read/write in Workspaces(0). a: w2 = DBEngine.CreateWorkspace(dbUseJet); dbw = w2.OpenDatabase(main, writable); w2.BeginTrans; UPDATE Wide SET V = 100 WHERE ID = 1 on dbw (dbFailOnError). b: UPDATE Wide SET V = 7 WHERE ID = 1; DBEngine.Errors; UPDATE Wide SET V = 8 WHERE ID = 64; DBEngine.Errors (both dbFailOnError). a: w2.Rollback; DBEngine.Errors. b: UPDATE Wide SET V = 9 WHERE ID = 1 (dbFailOnError); DBEngine.Errors; DBEngine.Idle(dbRefreshCache); read Wide rows 1, 2 and 64 through a new snapshot. a: DBEngine.Idle(dbRefreshCache); read Wide rows 1, 2 and 64 through a new snapshot; w2.Close.",
